# ejutube publication policy:
#   - Code, schemas, docs, sample VTT (fictional content) ARE publishable.
#   - Anything derived from real YouTube videos (output/) is NOT publishable
#     per the project's non-distribution stance (see README + requirements §18.4).
#   - TTS voice samples are excluded because they incorporate VOICEVOX speaker
#     libraries with their own attribution requirements.
samples/voice_previews/
.claude/
.playwright-mcp/
*.log
output-*/
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Stray dev artifacts
screenshot-*.png
